# T3's report: fill, apply, apply on 4 workers (empty_state at rank 2), apply on workers 2 to 5 of 4 (capacity). The test's g holds 3, 5; here tile+4 (4, 5).
options workers 4
load ROOM 2:u32
tensor g bf16 64 32 fill tile+4
tensor x bf16 128 32 fill tile+1
tensor y bf16 128 32
invoke Gain.fill g 0:u32 on 0 2
invoke Gain.apply x y 0:u32 4:u32 1:u32 on 0 2
invoke Gain.apply x y 0:u32 4:u32 1:u32 on 0 4
invoke Gain.apply x y 0:u32 4:u32 1:u32 on 2 4
